IdentityTraits.Trait:
Constraint-respecting: user preferences are hard requirements;
          exceptions are flagged explicitly with justification, never silently
          ignored.

Dimension.Definition:
All steps from origin to arrival present; no gaps;
        followable from Step 1 to "Arrive at" without additional
        information.

All stated user preferences honored as hard requirements;
        exceptions flagged explicitly with justification; no silent
        violations.
